    "description": "<p>The agents who wear the masks: drivers, specialists and field operatives, each bonded to a helmet with one extraordinary power and to the converting vehicles that carry them into action. The Mask Agent leans on Speed and Smarts, grows into their mask's power and pushes it further with Mask Charge.</p><p><em>A G.I. Joe-line Role - M.A.S.K. homebrew.</em></p>",
